  <description>
    <p>
      Paraphrase is a private AI writing assistant: a grammar checker, spell checker,
      paraphrasing tool and smart reply writer that runs offline, on your own computer. The
      AI model (Google Gemma, a local LLM) works without the internet, so what you write never
      leaves your computer: no account, no cloud and no usage data.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Grammar checker and spell check: fix spelling, grammar and punctuation, with every change shown and one Undo per change</li>
      <li>Paraphrase and rewrite: change the tone to professional, polite, friendly, casual, confident, concise or more detailed, keeping every name, date and number</li>
      <li>Smart reply: three quick replies to a message, or a full email reply or chat reply from a few words of yours</li>
      <li>Summarize a long email or document, or turn notes into bullet points, a table or an email</li>
      <li>Translate, tested in English, Hindi and Hinglish, and on a best-effort basis in many more languages</li>
      <li>Write an email, a message, a social media post or a note from a short description</li>
      <li>Custom actions: your own instructions, saved as actions of their own</li>
      <li>Over any app: select text, press the global shortcut, and put the result back where the text was; or use the window, paste, pick an action and copy</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The AI model is downloaded once from its maker, at a fixed version, and checked before
      use. Downloading a model is the only time Paraphrase goes online.
    </p>
  </description>

